SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Ben Easton
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nTip Ben!\nCheck out Ben’s song list\nMake a request here!\nBen Easton is a keyboardist\, writer & producer based in New York City. Ben’s Live Piano Karaoke songlist offers 4\,000 tunes available for your singing pleasure — running the gamut from classic pop\, rock and Broadway to emo/pop-punk favorites and ’00s indie-rock deep cuts.\nEaston is a core member & songwriter of the eclectic rock band The Academy Blues Project (”If you’re into psychedelic rock and you’re in New York right now\, ABP should be at the top of your bucket list” – NY Music Daily). The band has released four LPs and played hundreds of live shows across 12 years of touring\, including performances at Brooklyn Academy of Music\, SteelStacks and residencies at countless NYC clubs\, including Groove\, Troost\, Union Hall and Joe’s Pub.\nFor all of Ben’s upcoming live appearances & more\, visit ben-easton.com.\n[Don’t see your favorite song on Ben’s list? Submit your suggestions for new songs HERE.]
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-with-ben-18/
LOCATION:New York Sid Gold’s Request Room\, 165 W 26th St\, New York\, NY\, 10001\, United States
CATEGORIES:New York Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Ben_Easton-2026-scaled.jpg
GEO:40.7459164;-73.9936869
