SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Kira Small
DESCRIPTION:CHOOSE A SONG FROM KIRA’S SONG LIST\nCLICK HERE TO MAKE A REQUEST!\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @kira-small   Paypal: @kirasmall  CashApp: $kirasmallmusic \nMilwaukee native Kira Small was barely of legal drinking age when she landed her first piano bar gig at New Orleans’ famed Pat O’Brien’s. In the years since\, she’s become an award-winning singer-songwriter (2018 Rocky Mountain Folks Fest\, 2012 Independent Music Awards)\, A-list Nashville hired gun vocalist (Martina McBride\, Garth Brooks\, Willie Nelson)\, Grand Ole Opry background vocalist\, Wonder Woman’s back-up singer and her crowning achievement: BAR MOM.  For more info visit www.kirasmall.com. IG: @kirasmall
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-w-kira-small-9-7/2026-05-24/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/kira-clara-screenshot.png
END:VEVENT
