SUMMARY:Special Sunday Karaoke with Jesse Morgan
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nCheck out Jesse’s song list and make a request!\nJesse Morgan\, MT-BC\, is a pianist\, gigging musician and a board-certified music therapist at C.S. Mott Children’s Hospital\, where he works with heart patients and their caregivers. For Jesse\, all good music comes from the heart. So if you came to sing from your heart\, he’s got you covered with his 88-key support system.
