SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Austin DuBois
DESCRIPTION:Choose a song from Austin’s song list\nMAKE A REQUEST HERE!\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @Austin-DuBois-2 \nAustin DuBois is a piano bar entertainer and songwriter\, born and raised in South of Northwestern Metro Detroit. He began his musical journey by learning Billy Joel songs on a light up casio\, which he still does to this day. While studying at the University of Michigan\, he began gigging at the local dueling piano clubs and hasn’t found anything better to do since! You can find him rocking the keys down on Broadway\, piano bars nationwide or in the middle of the ocean somewhere. \nIG: @adubs6
