SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Brandon Reeves
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nCheck out Brandon’s song list and make a request!\nA professional pianist\, drummer\, and singer\, Brandon Reeves\, a.k.a. “Steely Bran\,” has cultivated a unique performing style—an All-American gumbo of homegrown music that weaves together the blues\, ragtime\, stride\, boogie\, rock n’ roll\, and\, most of all\, the funk and rhythm-and-blues sounds of New Orleans into a distinct and powerful sound. In addition\, Brandon works as the Hammond B3 organist at Conquering King Missionary Baptist in Detroit\, and teaches piano and drums privately. With a gifted musical ear and a large repertoire of music old and new\, Brandon can handle just about any request with equal aplomb. And if it’s not on the list—just ask!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-with-brandon-5/
