SUMMARY:Ditties For Kitties – Catio Fundraiser w/Kira
DESCRIPTION:** ALL TIPS WILL GO TO THE CATIO CAT LOUNGE ** \nKira & Glen have been fostering cats since 2019 and MANY of the furbabies who’ve come through their home have found their forever families at The Catio Cat Lounge. \nThe Catio Cat Lounge\, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit in Nashville\, is dedicated to rescuing and rehoming cats and kittens from high-kill shelters and the streets. As the largest-capacity catio in the US\, they are often the first call for senior and special-needs cats in urgent need of placement. Since opening in 2019\, The Catio has found loving homes for over 6\,000 cats and has become a beloved resource for animal lovers across Middle Tennessee and beyond. \n“During our recent remodel\, we were closed for over a month\, which caused our operations to suffer. Even though we were closed for business\, we still had to pay for food\, litter\, medical expenses\, payroll\, insurance\, and electric. When we reopened\, we were hit again with $4\,800 in two critical vet bills and $1\,150 to replace broken appliances. We are calling on compassionate individuals and businesses to help sustain our vital work. The only thing that keeps us going through these setbacks is the generous support of our community.” \n\nDonate: https://www.gofundme.com/f/support-the-catio-cat-cafes-mission\nLearn more: https://www.thecationashville.com/\n••••••••••••• \nCHOOSE A SONG FROM KIRA’S SONG LIST\nMAKE A REQUEST!\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @kira-small   Paypal: @kirasmall  CashApp: $kirasmallmusic \nMilwaukee native Kira Small was barely of legal drinking age when she landed her first piano bar gig at New Orleans’ famed Pat O’Brien’s. In the years since\, she’s become an award-winning singer-songwriter (2018 Rocky Mountain Folks Fest\, 2012 Independent Music Awards)\, A-list Nashville hired gun vocalist (Martina McBride\, Garth Brooks\, Willie Nelson)\, Grand Ole Opry background vocalist and Wonder Woman’s back-up singer and her crowning achievement: BAR MOM. For more info visit www.kirasmall.com.
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/ditties-for-kitties-catio-fundraiser-w-kira-2/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Ditties-For-Kitties-2026.png
END:VEVENT
